// 2784
[struct_2784]
param=param_2095,General Khazard
param=param_2096,29
param=param_2153,npc_14564
param=param_2168,npc_14566
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2183,npc_14565
param=param_2184,This skeletal Mahjarrat is one of the youngest of his race. He doesn't seem to have a guilty conscience about kidnapping rich people to fight in his arena, so he probably won't worry about fighting dirty.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Fight Arena<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: He starts off small and ugly, but when you kill his first version you'll be confronted with a larger, deadlier and, quite possibly, uglier version of the Mahjarrat man. He attacks with melee.
param=param_2102,Taste my vengeance.
param=param_2118,vorbis_8065
param=param_2119,vorbis_8065
param=param_2120,vorbis_8065
param=param_2121,vorbis_8065
param=param_2122,3400
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_general_khazard

// 2785
[struct_2785]
param=param_2095,The Black Knight Guardian
param=param_2096,30
param=param_2153,npc_14454
param=param_2168,npc_14455
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,3
param=param_2184,This armour-clad man is an elite guard from the Kinshra (a Zamorakian military order). If it was possible to see his face beneath his mask, a mixture of anger and hatred would be seen.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: A Void Dance<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The knight attacks with basic melee, but has the special ability of replenishing his life points when his health gets below a certain amount by draining your prayer.
param=param_2102,Give up! You don't stand a chance!
param=param_2118,vorbis_7942
param=param_2119,vorbis_7942
param=param_2120,vorbis_7942
param=param_2121,vorbis_7942
param=param_2122,1500
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_black_knight_guardian

// 2786
[struct_2786]
param=param_2095,Dad
param=param_2096,31
param=param_2153,npc_14517
param=param_2168,npc_14518
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Like most trolls, Dad was named after his first attempt to eat his own father. Like a giant rock, there's not a great deal of intellect there, but some impressive might. You've been warned.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Troll Stronghold<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: As well as bashing your brains in with melee combat, Dad has an attack that will hit through pretty much any defence, knocking you back a few paces.
param=param_2102,Smash the human!
param=param_2118,vorbis_7990
param=param_2119,vorbis_7990
param=param_2120,vorbis_7990
param=param_2121,vorbis_7990
param=param_2122,1200
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_dad

// 2787
[struct_2787]
param=param_2095,Dramen Tree Spirit
param=param_2096,32
param=param_2153,npc_14551
param=param_2168,npc_14552
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,The guardian of the rare dramen tree, the spirit exists as a guardian to the tree; wood of which is key for any wanting to travel to the plane of Zanaris.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Lost City<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Now you can show the spirit how tough you are with more than an axe! (No, you can't hide behind mushrooms to make it easier).
param=param_2102,Be away with you mortal
param=param_2118,vorbis_8067
param=param_2119,vorbis_8067
param=param_2120,vorbis_8067
param=param_2121,vorbis_8067
param=param_2122,850
