param=param_2168,npc_14527
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Many have heard of the phrase 'a wolf in sheep's clothing'. However, this is a man in a bear costume.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Mountain Daughter<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Grrrr! Still dressed in his stinky costume, he will attack you with melee combat, trying his best to slice you up with his claws.
param=param_2102,Die! *ahem* Roar!
param=param_2118,vorbis_7975
param=param_2119,vorbis_7975
param=param_2120,vorbis_7975
param=param_2121,vorbis_7975
param=param_2122,500
