param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,4
param=param_2184,For most warriors, fighting Nomad was difficult enough once, so this is one of the most difficult (one-off) battles. It's a real test of skill to beat him twice in a row without a chance to recuperate.<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: You will be pitched against Nomad twice in a row without the option of replenishing your inventory for food or for taking a breather. The rules will be the same as in a normal battle with no handicaps.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quests required to play</col>: Nomad's Requiem.
